# The arguments of every engine entry that runs Flip's runsc (runsc and
# cua-runsc). Flip's updater registers exactly these from the runsc tarball, and
# the release's overlay proof runs with them.
--allow-suid
# Root filesystem writes go to the engine's layer and stay across a stop.
--overlay2=none
--nvproxy-allowed-driver-capabilities=compute,utility,graphics,video
